ower temperature and longer lifespan</p><p>·Food grade oil keep the water clean</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Cable</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240931021530846.jpg\"/></p><p>·Material is durable and reliable</p><p>·Cable is produced by JIADI</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Impeller:</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240931115681342.jpg\"/></p><p>·High durable PPO impeller and diffuser (high flow model with S/S diffuser), sand resistant</p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Bearing</p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240931222303715.jpg\"/></p><p>·Better balance and less noise</p><p>·Motors can run more steadily and smoothly</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Packaging &amp; Shipping</strong></p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF), etc</p><p>Payment terms: L/C,D/A, D/P, T/T ,Western Union, MoneyGram, PayPal</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: 20-30 days</p><p>Shipment: By sea, by air and by express delivery</p><p>Supply Capability: 100,000 Pieces per Month</p><p>Packing: Carton (with cylinder or plastic foam), wooden box</p><p><strong>5. Product Application</strong></p><p>JIADI bore hole submersible pump can be applied to various areas：</p><p>Factories</p><p>Home</p><p>Construction</p><p>Farm irrigation and drainage </p><p>Urban and rural household use</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240934499186718.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Company Profile</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240934542560905.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image021(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Taizhou Jiadi pump industry Co., Ltd. is a well-known enterprise producing water pumps professionally and manufacturing small submersible screw electric pumps. For many years it has b